{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55724","headline":"颂 三 · 师备","name":"颂 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里神光顶後相，没顶之时何处望。\n事己成，意已（《五灯会元》作「亦」）休，此个从来（《五灯会元》作「来踪」）触处周。\n智者聊闻猛（《五灯会元》作「撩着便」）提取，莫待须臾失却头。\n（均见《景德传灯录》卷二九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55724.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55724","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}